#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:9
msgid "Write micro-benchmarks"
msgstr "编写微基准测试"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:11
msgid ""
"Micro-benchmarks answer isolated performance questions. Asset benchmarks use"
" backend-specific **mock views** to measure an asset method or data "
"property. Sensor benchmarks use **live simulation scenes** to measure a "
"production sensor update after physics has completed. Neither type predicts "
"end-to-end environment or training throughput. Use "
":ref:`developer_tools_benchmarking_run` for environment logic, policy "
"inference, learning, or application startup."
msgstr ""
"微基准测试回答单项性能问题。资产测试使用后端专用 **模拟视图** ，测量资产方法或数据属性；传感器测试使用 **实际仿真场景** "
"，测量物理步完成后的正式传感器更新。两者都不能预测端到端环境或训练吞吐量。环境逻辑、策略推理、学习或应用启动的测量见 "
":ref:`developer_tools_benchmarking_run` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:20
msgid ""
"For the typed Python API, formatter and recorder internals, or custom "
"producers, see :ref:`developer_tools_benchmarking_api`."
msgstr ""
"带类型的 Python API、格式化器和记录器内部实现，以及自定义数据生成器，见 "
":ref:`developer_tools_benchmarking_api` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:24
msgid "Choose a suite and backend"
msgstr "选择测试套件与后端"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:26
msgid ""
"Run commands from the repository root through ``./isaaclab.sh``. The active "
"Python environment must contain the backend being measured. PhysX and Newton"
" asset benchmarks run kitless with mock views. PhysX sensor benchmarks "
"launch Isaac Sim. Newton sensor benchmarks run kitless with the installed "
"Newton runtime. OVPhysX runs kitless with its optional ``ovphysx`` runtime "
"wheel. Use CUDA for representative GPU numbers. CPU execution is useful for "
"correctness or profiling, but it is a different workload. Do not mix CPU and"
" CUDA results."
msgstr ""
"从仓库根目录通过 ``./isaaclab.sh`` 运行命令。当前 Python 环境必须已安装被测后端。PhysX 和 Newton "
"资产测试使用模拟视图，不依赖 Kit；PhysX 传感器测试启动 Isaac Sim；Newton 传感器测试使用已安装的 Newton 运行时，不依赖"
" Kit；OVPhysX 使用可选的 ``ovphysx`` 运行时 wheel，也不依赖 Kit。具有代表性的 GPU 性能数据应使用 "
"CUDA。CPU 执行适合正确性检查或性能分析，但属于不同负载，不能混合比较 CPU 和 CUDA 结果。"

