#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:89
msgid "Run an asset benchmark"
msgstr "运行资产测试"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:91
msgid ""
"Asset benchmarks isolate Python input handling, tensor or index conversion, "
"Isaac Lab method logic, backend binding calls, and data-property "
"computation. They run method then data-property phases and write separate "
"historical method and data artifacts. Existing result ingestion continues to"
" work. Methods cover supported state writes, targets, forces, and material "
"or mass properties. Data benchmarks cover backend-supported cached and "
"derived properties."
msgstr ""
"资产测试单独测量 Python 输入处理、张量或索引转换、Isaac Lab "
"方法逻辑、后端绑定调用及数据属性计算。测试依次运行方法阶段和数据属性阶段，并分别写入沿用历史格式的方法与数据产物，使现有结果读取方式继续有效。方法覆盖受支持的状态写入、目标、力，以及材料或质量属性；数据测试覆盖后端支持的缓存属性和派生属性。"

