#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:164
msgid ""
"Sensor benchmarks build a live scene and exercise production sensors. The "
"defaults reduce timing noise: 4096 environments, 50 warm-up updates, and 500"
" timed updates. The benchmark steps the selected backend to create fresh "
"source data. It does not time that physics step."
msgstr ""
"传感器测试构建实际场景，运行正式传感器。默认使用 4096 个环境、50 次预热更新和 500 "
"次计时更新，以减少计时噪声。测试推进所选后端以生成新的源数据，但该物理步不计时。"

