#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:221
msgid ""
"By default, ray-caster commands run a plane workload and a deterministic, "
"seeded rough-terrain workload. They report ``plane_sensor_update`` and "
"``rough_sensor_update`` separately. Each workload has matching observer and "
"validation phases. Pass ``--terrain plane`` or ``--terrain rough`` to run "
"only one workload."
msgstr ""
"射线投射命令默认运行平面负载，以及具有固定随机种子的确定性崎岖地形负载，分别报告 ``plane_sensor_update`` 和 "
"``rough_sensor_update`` 。每项负载都有对应的测量开销与验证阶段。传入 ``--terrain plane`` 或 "
"``--terrain rough`` ，可只运行一种负载。"

