#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:366
msgid ""
"The default sensor ``summary`` formatter prints a terminal report and writes"
" JSON. Add ``--output_path results/sensors`` to keep artifacts outside the "
"repository root. ``--benchmark_formatter json`` writes JSON without the "
"terminal summary. Use ``osmo`` or ``omniperf`` to select their ingestion "
"formats. PhysX scripts also expose ``--disable_graph`` or "
"``--disable_recorded_launch`` where applicable. These diagnostic controls "
"compare production cached or graph paths with eager launches. Leave them "
"disabled when measuring default production behavior."
msgstr ""
"传感器默认的 ``summary`` 格式化器打印终端报告并写入 JSON。添加 ``--output_path results/sensors`` "
"，可将产物放在仓库根目录之外。 ``--benchmark_formatter json`` 只写 JSON，不打印终端摘要； ``osmo`` 和 "
"``omniperf`` 选择各自的数据接收格式。适用时，PhysX 脚本还提供 ``--disable_graph`` 或 "
"``--disable_recorded_launch`` "
"。这些诊断选项用于比较正式的缓存或计算图路径与即时启动方式。测量默认正式行为时，不要启用这些禁用选项。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:376
msgid "Understand the timing boundary"
msgstr "理解计时边界"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:378
msgid "Sensor benchmarks use this timing boundary:"
msgstr "传感器测试采用以下计时边界："

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:390
msgid ""
"The shared :func:`~isaaclab.benchmark.measure_latency` helper enforces both "
"synchronization boundaries and returns host-submission and synchronized-"
"completion times. The first synchronization keeps pending simulation, "
"policy, or unrelated kernels out of the sensor sample. The runner measures "
"the same synchronized no-op boundary separately to show observer cost. Asset"
" benchmarks instead time each method or property call after an untimed warm-"
"up."
msgstr ""
"共享工具 :func:`~isaaclab.benchmark.measure_latency` "
"执行两处同步，并返回主机提交时间与同步后的完成时间。首次同步将待完成的仿真、策略或无关核函数排除在传感器样本之外。运行器还单独测量相同同步边界下的空操作，以显示测量本身的开销。资产测试则在不计时的预热后，测量各方法或属性调用。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:399
msgid "Read the result"
msgstr "读取结果"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:401
msgid ""
"Asset scripts print the mean and standard deviation for every method or mode"
" pair in microseconds. They also print mode comparisons when applicable. "
"Each script writes a timestamped JSON file to ``--output_dir``. The file "
"contains the configuration, hardware and software metadata, phase names, and"
" measurements. The script prints the output path when it finishes. "
"Articulation method artifacts also contain the finder and raw index-kernel "
"phases described above."
msgstr ""
"资产脚本以微秒打印每个方法与模式组合的均值和标准差，适用时还打印模式比较。各脚本向 ``--output_dir`` 写入带时间戳的 "
"JSON，包含配置、硬件与软件元数据、阶段名和测量结果，完成时打印输出路径。关节体方法产物还包含上述查找阶段和原始索引核函数阶段。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:0
msgid "Illustrative sensor terminal summary (not reference performance)"
msgstr "传感器终端摘要示例（并非参考性能）"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:0
msgid "Illustrative JSON measurement (not reference performance)"
msgstr "JSON 测量示例（并非参考性能）"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:448
msgid ""
"Generated sensor artifacts contain ``mean``, sample ``std``, ``n``, and "
"``unit`` for each statistical measurement. The p50 and p95 values are "
"separate measurements in the same phase."
msgstr ""
"生成的传感器产物为每项统计测量包含 ``mean`` 、样本 ``std`` 、 ``n`` 和 ``unit`` 。p50、p95 "
"是同一阶段中的独立测量项。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:452
msgid "``Synchronized Completion``"
msgstr "``Synchronized Completion``"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:453
msgid ""
"Wall-clock latency from immediately before the sensor operation until all "
"work it submitted completes. It is the primary comparison metric."
msgstr "从传感器操作开始前，到其提交的全部工作完成为止的实际延迟，是主要比较指标。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:456
msgid "``Host Submission``"
msgstr "``Host Submission``"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:457
msgid ""
"Host time until the operation returns, before post-boundary synchronization."
" It measures enqueue and dispatch cost, not GPU execution."
msgstr "操作返回前的主机耗时，不包含后续边界同步。它测量入队和分派成本，而非 GPU 执行时间。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:460
msgid "``Synchronized Observer Floor``"
msgstr "``Synchronized Observer Floor``"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:461
msgid ""
"Cost of the same synchronized timing boundary around a no-op. It quantifies "
"measurement overhead and is never subtracted automatically. Contact cadence "
"uses the same ``decimation + 1`` boundaries as its sensor sample. Ray-caster"
" benchmarks report a matching observer phase for every selected terrain."
msgstr ""
"相同同步计时边界包围空操作的成本，用于量化测量开销，从不自动扣除。接触更新周期使用与传感器样本相同的 ``decimation + 1`` "
"个边界。射线投射测试为每种所选地形报告对应的测量开销阶段。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:466
msgid "``p50`` and ``p95``"
msgstr "``p50`` 和 ``p95``"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:467
msgid ""
"Median and 95th-percentile latency within one process. They expose jitter a "
"mean can hide. Use JSON ``std`` for within-process variation."
msgstr "单个进程内的中位数与第 95 百分位延迟，可揭示均值掩盖的抖动。进程内波动使用 JSON 的 ``std`` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:470
msgid "``Synchronized Native Read``"
msgstr "``Synchronized Native Read``"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:471
msgid ""
"An OVPhysX phase for an isolated blocking backend read. A missing phase "
"means that no equivalent read is exposed. It does not mean the read costs "
"zero."
msgstr "OVPhysX 中，单独执行阻塞式后端读取的阶段。缺少该阶段表示未提供等价读取，而非读取成本为零。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:474
msgid "``Estimated Synchronized Non-read Time``"
msgstr "``Estimated Synchronized Non-read Time``"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:475
msgid ""
"The OVPhysX full synchronized-update mean minus the native-read mean. The "
"two phases are sampled separately. Noise can dominate the estimate when "
"their values are close. This is not direct kernel timing."
msgstr "OVPhysX 完整同步更新的均值减去原生读取均值。两个阶段分别采样；当数值接近时，噪声可能主导估算。这不是直接的核函数计时。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:479
msgid "``validation``"
msgstr "``validation``"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:480
msgid ""
"Counts demonstrating expected contacts, finite frames, sensor outputs, "
"nonzero wrenches, or ray hits. Invalid output exits with an error rather "
"than producing a valid-looking result. Ray-caster validation is terrain-"
"specific. It checks plane hits against z=0. For rough terrain, it reports "
"the finite hit-height range."
msgstr ""
"用于证明预期接触、数值有限的坐标变换、传感器输出、非零力旋量或射线命中的计数。输出无效时，程序报错退出，而不会生成看似有效的结果。射线投射验证按地形分别进行：平面命中与"
" z=0 比较，崎岖地形则报告有限的命中高度范围。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:487
msgid "Compare runs"
msgstr "比较运行结果"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:489
msgid "For a performance claim:"
msgstr "要据此说明性能："

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:491
msgid ""
"Use the same workstation, GPU and CPU conditions, software environment, "
"device, benchmark file, dimensions, warm-up count, and timed count. The CPU "
"model, frequency, and load affect Python, dispatch, and synchronization "
"costs. This remains true when the measured tensors are on the GPU. Compare "
"the same ray-caster terrain phase."
msgstr ""
"使用相同工作站、GPU 和 CPU 状态、软件环境、设备、测试文件、维度、预热次数和计时次数。CPU 型号、频率和负载影响 "
"Python、分派和同步开销，即使被测张量位于 GPU 上也一样。射线投射应比较相同地形阶段。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:496
msgid "Run baseline and candidate configurations in separate clean processes."
msgstr "在独立、干净的进程中运行基准与候选配置。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:497
msgid ""
"Use at least three repetitions per configuration and report the mean plus "
"between-run standard deviation."
msgstr "每种配置至少重复三次，报告均值和跨运行的标准差。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:499
msgid "Check validation output and retain the raw JSON artifacts."
msgstr "检查验证输出，并保留原始 JSON 产物。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:500
msgid ""
"Compare the same metric: not asset microseconds with sensor milliseconds, "
"host submission with synchronized latency, or sensor latency with "
"environment FPS."
msgstr "比较同一指标：不要把资产微秒耗时与传感器毫秒耗时、主机提交与同步延迟，或传感器延迟与环境 FPS 混为一谈。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:503
msgid ""
"Treat startup separately. Compilation, scene creation, physics "
"initialization, and CUDA graph construction are outside reported sensor "
"update latency but affect total command duration."
msgstr "启动过程单独处理。编译、场景创建、物理初始化和 CUDA 图构建不包含在报告的传感器更新延迟中，但影响命令总时长。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:507
msgid ""
"Published Isaac Lab performance comparisons must be collected on the project"
" designated benchmark workstation with complete hardware and run provenance."
" Local runs are appropriate for correctness checks and investigation, but "
"must not be presented as official reference numbers."
msgstr ""
"公开发布的 Isaac Lab "
"性能比较，必须在项目指定的性能测试工作站采集，并提供完整硬件和运行来源信息。本地运行适合正确性检查和排查，但不能作为官方参考数据。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:514
msgid ""
"Contact protocols are not yet identical across backends. PhysX and Newton "
"measure a configurable ``--decimation`` physics-step cadence plus a data "
"read. OVPhysX measures one forced update after every physics step. Use "
"contact results for within-backend regressions unless the protocols are "
"aligned."
msgstr ""
"各后端的接触测量协议尚不完全一致。PhysX 和 Newton 测量可配置的 ``--decimation`` "
"个物理步周期，加上一次数据读取；OVPhysX 则测量每个物理步后的强制更新。协议未对齐时，接触结果只应用于同一后端内的性能退化检查。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:520
msgid "Add a benchmark"
msgstr "添加性能测试"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:523
msgid "Add an asset case"
msgstr "添加资产测试项"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:525
msgid ""
"Define shared methods with "
":class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.asset_suites.AssetMethodSpec` and shared data "
"properties with :class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.asset_suites.AssetPropertySpec`."
" Declare shared property prerequisites through "
"``AssetPropertySpec.dependencies``. Use adapter "
"``property_dependency_overrides`` only when a backend needs different "
"dependencies. Keep backend-specific target construction, refresh behavior, "
"capabilities, and generator overrides in the backend adapter. Allocate "
"inputs before the timed call. Keep equivalent backend behavior aligned where"
" the API is shared. Do not register a mode or property that a backend cannot"
" implement meaningfully."
msgstr ""
"用 :class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.asset_suites.AssetMethodSpec` 定义共享方法，用 "
":class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.asset_suites.AssetPropertySpec` 定义共享数据属性。通过 "
"``AssetPropertySpec.dependencies`` 声明共享属性的前置依赖；只有后端需要不同依赖时，才使用适配器的 "
"``property_dependency_overrides`` "
"。后端专用的目标构建、刷新行为、能力和生成器覆盖项应保留在后端适配器中。输入应在计时调用前分配。共享 API "
"的等价后端行为应保持一致。不要注册后端无法有意义地实现的模式或属性。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:537
msgid "Add a sensor workload"
msgstr "添加传感器负载"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:539
msgid ""
"Build the smallest live scene that exercises the production sensor path."
msgstr "构建能运行正式传感器路径的最小实际场景。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:540
msgid "Warm simulation and sensor updates before collecting samples."
msgstr "采样前，预热仿真与传感器更新。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:541
msgid "Keep ``sim.step()`` and validation untimed."
msgstr "``sim.step()`` 和验证不计时。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:542
msgid ""
"Collect samples with :func:`~isaaclab.benchmark.measure_latency`. Do not "
"duplicate clock, synchronization, percentile, or unit-conversion logic."
msgstr ""
"通过 :func:`~isaaclab.benchmark.measure_latency` 采样，不要重复实现时钟、同步、百分位数或单位转换逻辑。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:544
msgid ""
"Publish samples through :class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.LatencyBenchmarkRunner` "
"with a matched synchronized observer floor."
msgstr ""
"通过 :class:`~isaaclab.benchmark.LatencyBenchmarkRunner` 输出样本，并提供匹配的同步测量开销基线。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:547
msgid ""
"Add workload dimensions and modes as metadata, and validation values as "
"measurements."
msgstr "将负载维度与模式作为元数据，验证值作为测量项。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:549
msgid ""
"Fail when output shapes, finite values, or physical signals are invalid."
msgstr "输出形状、有限值或物理信号无效时，应报错。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:550
msgid "Document each backend-specific timing phase or protocol difference."
msgstr "记录各后端专用计时阶段或协议差异。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:553
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:556
msgid "Import or backend errors"
msgstr "导入或后端错误"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:558
msgid ""
"Confirm the backend is installed in the Python environment selected by "
"``./isaaclab.sh``. OVPhysX requires its optional runtime wheel. PhysX sensor"
" benchmarks require Isaac Sim."
msgstr ""
"确认 ``./isaaclab.sh`` 选择的 Python 环境已安装对应后端。OVPhysX 需要可选运行时 wheel；PhysX "
"传感器测试需要 Isaac Sim。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:563
msgid "CUDA out of memory"
msgstr "CUDA 显存不足"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:565
msgid ""
"Reduce ``--num_instances`` for assets or ``--num_envs`` for sensors. Record "
"the reduced size because latency scaling changes with workload size."
msgstr ""
"资产测试减小 ``--num_instances`` ，传感器测试减小 ``--num_envs`` "
"。记录缩减后的规模，因为延迟随负载规模的变化规律会改变。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:569
msgid "Slow first process"
msgstr "首次进程运行缓慢"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:571
msgid ""
"The command can compile Warp kernels, build a scene, initialize physics, or "
"capture CUDA graphs before measurement. Warm-up excludes this work from "
"reported operation latency, but not total command duration."
msgstr ""
"测量前，命令可能编译 Warp 核函数、构建场景、初始化物理或捕获 CUDA 图。预热将这些工作排除在报告的操作延迟之外，但不排除在命令总时长之外。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:576
msgid "Noisy results"
msgstr "结果噪声较大"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/micro_benchmarks.rst:578
msgid ""
"Ensure no other GPU workload is active. Increase timed iterations, repeat in"
" independent processes, and report between-run variation. A difference "
"smaller than normal variation is not evidence of a regression or "
"improvement."
msgstr "确保没有其他 GPU 负载运行。增加计时迭代次数，在独立进程中重复，并报告跨运行波动。小于正常波动的差异，不能证明性能退化或改善。"
